// The CPropTree based settings pages - IDD_OE_SQL_FORMAT_TREE,
// IDD_OE_PLSQL_OUTLINE_TREE, IDD_OE_EDITING_TREE, IDD_OE_GENERAL_TREE and
// IDD_OE_FILES_WORKSPACE_TREE - have no dialog template of their own: they all
// use the shared empty IDD_PROPTREE_PAGE from Common/PropTreePage.rc, and
// Common::CPropTreePage assigns their title (m_psp.pszTitle) and help id
// (m_nIDHelp) in code. Their IDD_ symbols are kept in OpenEditorInc.rh, where
// they serve as help ids only.
// The IDD_OE_GENERAL, IDD_OE_FILES and IDD_OE_WORKSPACE templates - and the
// DLGINIT block below the first - are still here because the classic
// COEGeneralPage, COEFilePage and OEWorkspacePage are kept as the reference for
// how each control was exchanged; those pages are excluded from the build. Note
// that IDD_OE_FILES and IDD_OE_WORKSPACE were MERGED into the one

